    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/78b99b2bc087368235001fb23172e026.avif?t=1744132138\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/b296ad776ea3534e2eb91efa07197e5d.poster.avif?t=1744132138\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/b296ad776ea3534e2eb91efa07197e5d.webm?t=1744132138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/b296ad776ea3534e2eb91efa07197e5d.mp4?t=1744132138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of meeting a character from the virtual world? <br>Now is your chance! Rococo, a girl trapped in the virtual world, is sending out a distress signal to you. <br>She longs to escape her digital cage and live with you in the real world. <br>However, saving her is no easy task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/e14111d2f1821fb1fa64503a16e50f5b.avif?t=1744132138\" data-has-big width=800 height=1200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An exhilarating adventure is about to unfold:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth Behind School Bullying:</strong> Piece together the truth about the school bullying incident by gathering clues scattered throughout the scenes. This is the key to saving Rococo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/038bc037535ea258730b0d345128e022.avif?t=1744132138\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Malice-Born Monsters:</strong> In the darkness lurk monsters born from malice, and they will stop at nothing to stand in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront Rococo's Multiple Personalities:</strong> Kind, evil, cunning\u2014you must find the true Rococo among her many personas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/0e459e0862df3ab8580339ac1214abdc.avif?t=1744132138\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating Storyline:</strong> A thrilling narrative full of twists and turns will immerse you completely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Interactive Experience:</strong> Interact with Rococo and objects in the environment to collect clues and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Character Design:</strong> Each character boasts a distinct personality, offering an unforgettable gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected Endings:</strong> Your choices will determine Rococo's fate and the direction of the entire story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/c4c5027a16a5661433211c0e062a8143.avif?t=1744132138\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>However, things are not so simple...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the real world, Rococo, who was rejected after confessing her feelings, discovers a game that allows her to kill at will. She sets the boy she likes as a character in the game, sinking into an endless cycle of exploitation and venting. The line between the virtual and real worlds begins to blur, and Rococo's mind starts to twist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you successfully save Rococo and pull her back from the abyss of both virtual and reality?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is in your hands!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/78b99b2bc087368235001fb23172e026.avif?t=1744132138\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/b296ad776ea3534e2eb91efa07197e5d.poster.avif?t=1744132138\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/b296ad776ea3534e2eb91efa07197e5d.webm?t=1744132138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/b296ad776ea3534e2eb91efa07197e5d.mp4?t=1744132138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of meeting a character from the virtual world? <br>Now is your chance! Rococo, a girl trapped in the virtual world, is sending out a distress signal to you. <br>She longs to escape her digital cage and live with you in the real world. <br>However, saving her is no easy task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/e14111d2f1821fb1fa64503a16e50f5b.avif?t=1744132138\" data-has-big width=800 height=1200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An exhilarating adventure is about to unfold:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth Behind School Bullying:</strong> Piece together the truth about the school bullying incident by gathering clues scattered throughout the scenes. This is the key to saving Rococo.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/038bc037535ea258730b0d345128e022.avif?t=1744132138\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Malice-Born Monsters:</strong> In the darkness lurk monsters born from malice, and they will stop at nothing to stand in your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Confront Rococo's Multiple Personalities:</strong> Kind, evil, cunning\u2014you must find the true Rococo among her many personas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/0e459e0862df3ab8580339ac1214abdc.avif?t=1744132138\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating Storyline:</strong> A thrilling narrative full of twists and turns will immerse you completely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Interactive Experience:</strong> Interact with Rococo and objects in the environment to collect clues and solve puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Character Design:</strong> Each character boasts a distinct personality, offering an unforgettable gaming experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unexpected Endings:</strong> Your choices will determine Rococo's fate and the direction of the entire story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3428500/extras/c4c5027a16a5661433211c0e062a8143.avif?t=1744132138\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>However, things are not so simple...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the real world, Rococo, who was rejected after confessing her feelings, discovers a game that allows her to kill at will. She sets the boy she likes as a character in the game, sinking into an endless cycle of exploitation and venting. The line between the virtual and real worlds begins to blur, and Rococo's mind starts to twist...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you successfully save Rococo and pull her back from the abyss of both virtual and reality?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything is in your hands!</strong></p>",
